#
# Build context of deploy/server/Dockerfile is the repository root. Kept out:
# history, dependencies and build output that the image rebuilds itself
# (web/node_modules and web/dist are rebuilt in the "web" stage, the jar in
# "build"). Agent packages stay in: AGENT_PACKAGES points at dist/, dist-new/,
# test/e2e/build/dist or a directory under test/packages/build.
.git/
.bin/
.gradle/
.kotlin/
**/node_modules/
web/dist/
build/
server/build/
proto/jvm/build/
test/e2e/build/*
!test/e2e/build/dist/
agent/bin/
cli/bin/
